{"body": {"notes": "My first release on Catalog commemorates the five year anniversary of my A Time May Come EP with a 1/1 NFT of the intro track. The song, an ode to watching movies alone in my grandmother's kitchen, uses percussion made from the sounds of that kitchen and a section of an improvisation on a Buchla 100 modular synthesizer.

