About Swimming: This is one of the first songs I made for this record, some three years ago. It benefited so much from Joel Ford’s (who mixed the record) guidance. When I first sent him the original demos he said he could hear slivers of “early 2000s French house music”, even though I was hearing was colder, more modular-based synth sounds. Anyways, that note sent me down a rabbit hole which resulted in the record you’re hearing today, and Swimming is one of the songs that benefitted most from that note. This track is truly meant for a dance floor. I’ve spent a lot of the last few years trying to craft “ambient music that you could dance to”, but this one is about as close as I get to a DJ tool.", "title": "Swimming", "artist": "Teen Daze", "artwork": {"nft": null, "info": {"uri": "https://ipfs.io/ipfs/bafybeictkq4dqqh3ahrb4t5nwihxk7prg3z33mar64q53rtzdkbcoxjtkm", "mimeType": "image/jpeg"}, "isNft": false}, "project": {"notes": null, "title": "Interior", "artwork": {"nft": null, "info": {"uri": "https://ipfs.io/ipfs/bafybeictkq4dqqh3ahrb4t5nwihxk7prg3z33mar64q53rtzdkbcoxjtkm", "mimeType": "image/jpeg"}, "isNft": false}}, "version": "catalog-20210202", "duration": 302.629, "mimeType": "audio/wav", "visualizer": null, "trackNumber": 1}, "origin": {"encoding": "rlp", "algorithm": "secp256k1", "publicKey": "0xc236541380fc0C2C05c2F2c6c52a21ED57c37952", "signature": "0xf3b60bac33aed41b9f7626e4df68c77f3394818a2548c825240bbc1e97e49305265b3141a339d51a0de57186cd59b14205f59f260bbe1589e219608910b614311b"}}

