{"body": {"notes": "2021 has been landmark for me - embracing web3, learning so much, building with new community and progressing towards dreams. This is my last drop for the year, acknowledging the journey so far, the sights, sounds and incredible destinations en route.

'Journeyman' is an instrumental head-nod excursion - chopping my own piano improvisations and reworking them, soundtracking the explorer walking the path, taking in subtle changes along the way, variations on a theme, before stumbling across whole new ideas, places and spaces that would never have been arrived to if not for undertaking the journey in the first place. The journey is neverending and it's so worth the trip. 

