{"body": {"notes": ""finding yourself (3rd eye)"

This song in particular was orginally slated as a demo for a drum kit that I had plans to release but never got to finish due to time constraints and illness. I still loved the track so I decided to fully flesh it out and work on it to see if it could be placed somewhere. I had plans to but it on my upcoming album but I accumilated too much material to choose from and it ultimately went into the vault until now.

This song gives off an almost ethereal-like feeling. It's meant to put you in a euphoric state and expand your mental whilst listening. I couldn't bare to keep this one hidden from the world so I decided to share it with you all. I appreciate anyone that places a bid on this gem!", "title": "finding yourself (3rd eye)", "artist": "LAKIM", "artwork": {"nft": null, "info": {"uri": "https://ipfs.io/ipfs/bafybeifiyjqwlakkxhrv5433q7yxekeegujuycvitf2alderaypkhuusq4", "mimeType": "image/jpeg"}, "isNft": false}, "project": null, "version": "catalog-20210202", "duration": 346.632, "mimeType": "audio/wav", "visualizer": null, "trackNumber": null}, "origin": {"encoding": "rlp", "algorithm": "secp256k1", "publicKey": "0xc236541380fc0C2C05c2F2c6c52a21ED57c37952", "signature": "0x7e7d2efd8f5578a80ea5c306e50db5c34c8d94a1c608db7bfb05359a65a7be045e874bbf9f5160cf8d4674a2ebd732043ed4b1e4aea61d14a7ba8d3df03adc821b"}}

